# 🛣️Welcome to Rysk

Rysk is the volatility yield layer of DeFi.

![](https://docs.rysk.finance/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F2559665757-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252F7tHAl50whbE5aof8T5A2%252Fuploads%252FNfAczZDBuH0tPNSJmSen%252Frysk_v12_cover.jpg%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3D7ad126c3-099c-4d7e-9678-fb41dc57dd4b&width=768&dpr=4&quality=100&sign=4e9dde1c&sv=2)

Rysk V12 introduces a new way to earn high, sustainable yield on ETH, BTC, and any volatile asset in DeFi. DeFi’s biggest gap has been obvious: scalable, efficient returns on its core assets. These assets are held by everyone, yet their yields remain low and unsustainable. Rysk fixes this by reimagining [covered calls](https://docs.rysk.finance/what-are-covered-calls), a proven strategy from traditional finance, and making it work for DeFi.

Covered calls have long been a powerful way to generate consistent returns, but past attempts to bring them on-chain faced challenges. We learned from those efforts, completely rethinking the approach to create a new financial primitive: liquid, tradable covered calls. Built for yield seekers, not just traders, Rysk makes earning yield simple, flexible, and accessible, with upfront USDC payouts and full customization.

- Instant USDC Yield: Earn immediately in USDC, ready to use, no waiting for expiry.

- Your Target Price: Choose your sell price, tailoring your risk and reward.

- Works with Many Assets: Supports ETH, BTC, LSTs, LRTs, and more.

- Trade Anytime: Full flexibility, no rigid schedules.

- Fair Pricing: RFQ system ensures the best price, fast and reliable.


Rysk isn’t just another vault or exchange, it’s a platform designed to scale sustainable yield across DeFi, for everyone: yield seekers, power DeFi users, treasuries, and institutions. No options expertise needed, just a simple UX that unlocks yield opportunities previously out of reach.

[Try Rysk V12 on testnet now](http://app.rysk.finance/)

